      "message": "I don\u0027t see any place where the hypervisor validates that this has succeeded before __pkvm_finalize_teardown_vm completes the destruction of this VM. The SP trusts that the hypervisor will not allow a new VM to start with the same vm-id until the destroy message has succeeded. It is important that the hypervisor ensures this even if the host has been compromised, so I think you need to save some state here when this call has succeeded.",
