      "writtenOn": "2025-05-29T20:01:13Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "That was a different question. Where, if anywhere, does the _hypervisor_ check that bitmap (or any other state) to make sure the destroy message has been completed before allowing the vm-id to be re-used. Only checking inside __pkvm_notify_guest_vm_avail is not sufficient, since the host can skip this call. PS#97 seems to make this more important since even a non-compromised host now might give up after 5 retries.",
